  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "She is an old woman with a hunched back, wheat yellow hair, a wrinkled face, and blurry eyes, wearing a brown yellow robe with a ring of sand around her waist. She is several thousand years old, with no records of her exact age. She had little lifespan and slept in Heavenly Court to delay death. She and Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord were from the same generation and were in a relationship during their younger years. His death at Yi Tian Mountain alarmed her, and she ended her hibernation on her own. Fairy Zi Wei asks her to refine Immortal Gu and restore Heaven Overseeing Tower. Granny Sha says the tower lord is dead and she could not save him, but she can rebuild the tower.",
      "chapters": [
        1069
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_heaven_overseeing_tower_lord",
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is an old woman with a hunched back, bending down. Her hair is yellow like wheat, her face is wrinkled, and her eyes are blurry. She wears a brown-yellow robe, and there is a ring of sand around her waist.",
      "chapters": [
        1069
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When a dragon shaped pillar of light rises from deep within the immortal graveyard, she stops refining Gu and goes with Wei Ling Yang to Fairy Zi Wei. She had also woken from hibernation, but her own waking was peaceful, unlike this tremor. Ordinary healing fails on the withered old man in the pit. As a refinement path expert she names three fires and three waters, all rank nine immortal materials in Heavenly Court’s stock, but those three waters do nothing. Seeing protrusions on the old man’s forehead, she takes out true dragon heavenly water, a rank eight immortal material, and pours it into his mouth. After he drinks five hundred grams he pushes her hands away, and she stops. Fairy Zi Wei names him Duke Long.",
      "chapters": [
        1228
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "reviving-a-stranger",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wei_ling_yang",
        "char_duke_long"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After she finishes repairing Heaven Overseeing Tower, Duke Long tells her she has contributed greatly. She says repairing the tower was that old man’s wish, laughs, and her body turns into sand. Wind scatters the sand. Gu Immortal Granny Sha, rank eight and refinement path great grandmaster, dies at that moment. She had little lifespan to begin with, and after Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord died she woke and spent the last spark of her life for Heavenly Court. Duke Long names her sacrifice together with Wei Ling Yang and Bi Chen Tian.",
      "chapters": [
        1335
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_bi_chen_tian"
      ]
    }
  ],
